%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 02ff5e751dcfd764781b6d35bf16d1e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Set_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  setName: The King Falls Ill
  narrativeSet:
  - paragraph: The ruler awakens weak but determined. Goblins raid the outskirts,
      their torches lighting the night. Soldiers rally to defend what remains of
      the crumbling kingdom.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "A hidden cave reveals an abandoned gold mine. The ruler\u2019s advisors
      rejoice \u2014 at last, the treasury may refill. But the echoes of mining stir
      something deep below."
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 500
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: Skeletons march through the fog, their eyes glowing with cursed fire.
      The ruler grips their sword, fevered yet unbroken, ready to reclaim the fallen
      gate.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 150
  - paragraph: The castle walls shudder under troll fists. Stones crack, banners
      fall, but the defenders hold fast. If the masons survive, they might rebuild
      before dawn.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 1
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1cc8a616fa2bfb408428e59980c6b38, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "A caravan arrives bearing medicine and armor. The ruler coughs, smiles
      faintly, and orders the guards to escort them safely \u2014 before the trolls
      scent blood again."
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 1
    econ: -200
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: -50
  - paragraph: The royal blacksmith reforges shattered weapons from fallen foes.
      Each strike echoes through the castle, a promise that not all is lost.
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 200
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "Deep in the catacombs, skeletons collapse as a holy relic is uncovered.
      The ruler\u2019s fever eases, if only for a night."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "A lone messenger returns with news of victory \u2014 the mines have
      been cleared. Gold will flow once more, if the ruler lives to see it"
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 1
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 400
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1cc8a616fa2bfb408428e59980c6b38, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: The Kings breaths grow ragged with each passing day but still, he
      valently sends his soldiers to fight the incoming threat. With each monster
      taken down, the kingdom grows more and more confident.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 400
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1cc8a616fa2bfb408428e59980c6b38, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: A healer arrives from distant lands, bearing rare herbs said to cure
      even kings. The guards pray her hands are steady.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 400
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1cc8a616fa2bfb408428e59980c6b38, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: A caravan crests the hill, loaded with coin and courage. Aid has come,
      if only for a time.
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 1
    econ: 50
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1cc8a616fa2bfb408428e59980c6b38, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: Gold awashes the treasurey once more. "Food!" the prince orders, "while
      my father is sick, we must focus our efforts on feeding the people."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 1
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ab883eb9ce71c843ba63c82619b7649, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: A neighbouring King hears about the horrors of your war and the tragedy
      of your King. He offers his Aid.
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 200
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ab883eb9ce71c843ba63c82619b7649, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
